    <briefdescription>
<para>Builds a table-level full-text search of a data-evolution table, aligned with Java <computeroutput>org.apache.paimon.table.source.FullTextSearchBuilder</computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It searches the global full-text indexes of one column and returns the highest-scoring rows:</para>
<para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classpaimon_1_1_full_text_search_builder_1a628c8528a99d8c22089023dea37866a0" kindref="member">FullTextSearchBuilder</ref><sp/><ref refid="memory__pool_8h_1a147ba4ba34a215b3a4f3a95c1ee11704" kindref="member">builder</ref>(<ref refid="memory__pool_8h_1a147ba4ba34a215b3a4f3a95c1ee11704" kindref="member">table_path</ref>);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="memory__pool_8h_1a147ba4ba34a215b3a4f3a95c1ee11704" kindref="member">builder</ref>.SetQuery(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;content&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/>R</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;({&quot;match&quot;:{&quot;query&quot;:&quot;paimon<sp/>lake&quot;}})&quot;).SetLimit(10);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="stringliteral"><ref refid="result_8h_1ab55bef8f9af15df1b25d799ec76c247c" kindref="member">PAIMON_ASSIGN_OR_RAISE</ref>(std::shared_ptr&lt;ScoredGlobalIndexResult&gt;<sp/><ref refid="memory__pool_8h_1a147ba4ba34a215b3a4f3a95c1ee11704" kindref="member">result</ref>,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="stringliteral"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="memory__pool_8h_1a147ba4ba34a215b3a4f3a95c1ee11704" kindref="member">builder</ref>.ExecuteLocal());</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="stringliteral">ScanContextBuilder<sp/><ref refid="memory__pool_8h_1a147ba4ba34a215b3a4f3a95c1ee11704" kindref="member">scan_builder</ref>(<ref refid="memory__pool_8h_1a147ba4ba34a215b3a4f3a95c1ee11704" kindref="member">table_path</ref>);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="stringliteral"><ref refid="memory__pool_8h_1a147ba4ba34a215b3a4f3a95c1ee11704" kindref="member">scan_builder</ref>.SetGlobalIndexResult(<ref refid="memory__pool_8h_1a147ba4ba34a215b3a4f3a95c1ee11704" kindref="member">result</ref>);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para><computeroutput><ref refid="classpaimon_1_1_full_text_search_builder_1a8bf72a0dee624cde37ddeec42e7fd6d0" kindref="member">ExecuteLocal()</ref></computeroutput> plans and searches in this process. To run them in different processes, plan with <computeroutput><ref refid="classpaimon_1_1_full_text_search_builder_1a448d4e471f5d985bcc829f5d3287521a" kindref="member">NewFullTextScan()</ref></computeroutput>, serialize the splits with <computeroutput><ref refid="classpaimon_1_1_full_text_search_split_1ad0e0afebe837af0b6a01ac4341fbec55" kindref="member">FullTextSearchSplit::Serialize()</ref></computeroutput>, and search them with the <computeroutput><ref refid="classpaimon_1_1_full_text_search_builder_1a744cc19cf588435300bb8b32235f6cd3" kindref="member">NewFullTextRead()</ref></computeroutput> of a builder for the same table, column and query.</para>
<para>The row ids of the result refer to the snapshot the search was planned from, which <computeroutput><ref refid="classpaimon_1_1_full_text_scan_1_1_plan_1a0c100e5d3d045b0e175d70e7a350b1fd" kindref="member">FullTextScan::Plan::SnapshotId()</ref></computeroutput> returns. If the table may change in between, pin the data scan to it with <computeroutput>scan.mode</computeroutput> = <computeroutput>from-snapshot</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>scan.snapshot-id</computeroutput>, or with the same <computeroutput>scan.tag-name</computeroutput> for a search of a tag, as the tag may outlive the snapshot. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
